L1: Acute effects of combined supplementation of L-arginine and citrulline malate on aerobic, anaerobic, and CrossFit exercise performance
L2: Scientific Reports (2025)
L3: Saranya Selvaraj, Leonidas Petridis, Hanna Majtényi, Henrietta Bartha, Ákos Tóth, Katinka Utczás, Margita Szilágyi-Utczás, Rachel Kimble, Reza Zare, Arash Akbari, Katie M. Heinrich
