L7: 4 https://ror.org/04w3d2v20 grid.15756.30 0000 0001 1091 500X Division of Sport, Exercise and Health, School of Health and Life Sciences,  University of the West of Scotland,  Blantyre, G720LH UK
L8: 5 grid.523589.0 SRH Campus Hamburg, SRH University of Applied Sciences Heidelberg,  20095 Hamburg, Germany
L9: 6 Damavand, Tehran Province Iran
L10: 7 https://ror.org/05p1j8758 grid.36567.31 0000 0001 0737 1259 Department of Kinesiology,  Kansas State University,  Manhattan, KS 66506 USA
